 "summary": "The graded exact pairing, the VecTwisted rigid structure, `IsZero.of_exactPairing` and the `ModuleCat` dual pairings have no counterpart in pinned Mathlib or Tau Ceti, and the PR reuses the existing pieces (`FGModuleCat.exactPairing`, `FGModuleCat.leftExactPairing`, `Functor.mapExactPairing`, `exactPairingFullSubcategory`, `exactPairingCongrLeft/Right`, `singleObjApplyIsoOfEq`) instead of reproving them. The small helpers (`HasFiniteSupport.toFinset`, `tensorUnitIsoOfEq`) are thin specialisations of `Set.Finite.toFinset` and `singleObjApplyIsoOfEq` with direct consumers in the new proofs.",
